    "title": "After the Crash: Acute and Protracted Withdrawal Across Amphetamine-Type Stimulants Beyond Methamphetamine",
    "abstract": "A substance-specific pilot evidence map of acute withdrawal, post-acute symptoms, treatment evidence, measurement validity, psychiatric overlap, and functional recovery after sustained amphetamine or methamphetamine exposure. The review explicitly labels direct amphetamine evidence, direct methamphetamine evidence, pooled amphetamine-type stimulant evidence, and extrapolation. It is an AI-assisted pilot awaiting human scientific review, not a clinical guideline or individualized medical advice.",
